  "description": {
    "en": "The order list (W-STOCK P5): per supply, the average daily use of the last 14 days (rounded up), par = use x (supplier lead days + days between its deliveries; 1 + 7 with no card), suggest = par - free - on order, rounded up to the supply's first pack; grouped by supplier card. Sent from the phone (navigator.share, else copied) in the supplier's language, then POST ordered marks it 'on its way' until deliveries after it close it (oldest first; forgotten after 14 days). The kitchen numbers' reorder hint is the same par with default lead and cycle (it replaced REORDER_BELOW_DAYS).",
    "uk": "Список замовлень по постачальниках: норма з середньої витрати, мінус вільне й те, що їде, цілими упаковками; надсилання з телефону."
  },
